cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the method paper listed under
  references and the part you used. Each released part carries its own
  citation metadata with its version: adaptels/python/CITATION.cff for
  pygeoadaptels, adaptels/r/CITATION.cff for rgeoadaptels,
  qgis/CITATION.cff for the QGIS plugin and sigments/CITATION.cff for
  sigments. This file names the repository as a whole.
title: "geosegments: image segmentation for geospatial rasters with adaptive superpixels and seeded growing, in Python, R and QGIS"
